  "term": "hemispheric communication",
  "definition": "Hemispheric communication is the exchange of information between the brain’s two hemispheres. In this source, reduced inter-hemispheric communication refers to a long-range connectivity problem linked to worse cognitive functioning and possible disease progression in amnestic mild cognitive impairment.",
